## Third-party notice

This repo contains ORIGINAL skills, prompts, playbooks, workflows, templates
and examples written for this project. It does NOT copy code, scripts or
prompts verbatim from third-party repositories.

Third-party tools and repos are referenced in docs/GITHUB_SOURCES.md by name,
URL, star count (November 2026 snapshot) and licence, with install commands.
They are not vendored here. Before commercial use, check each project's
licence, terms and pricing yourself, because licences change.

Notable warnings (see docs/GITHUB_SOURCES.md for the full table):

- joeseesun/opus-video-prompts — no licence stated. Do not reuse its content
  commercially. Treat it as inspiration only, and write original prompts.
- Remotion — source-available, free for up to 3 people; a Company Licence is needed at 4+ people
  (headcount, not revenue). Check the current Remotion licence before commercial renders.
- Face-swap / Deep-Live-Cam style tools — do not use on real people without
  explicit written consent. This repo contains no face-swap code or workflow.
- Paid cloud video APIs and stock footage — check each provider's terms,
  pricing, and commercial-use rights, and keep proof in outputs/<slug>/.
- Stock music, fonts, footage and celebrity likenesses are not included here.
  Licence them separately and keep proof in outputs/<slug>/.

No warranty is given for third-party tools, models, or their outputs.
You are responsible for brand safety, consent, claims and platform compliance
for every ad you ship with this repo.
